 "1507162731212721", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312236_1507162734546054_4260331267881194815_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=otQkcwhIgJIQ7kNvwH-a-wb&_nc_oc=AdpEYe1wg0aSuUgsTgvb_OOhZaUwT-zOL0rsIROh_tP1afKuprN67ODXSWkAVp-U6jk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTfkTmkjzA30Y1aXytdcMBsl_CEWX1_IB2qZrpyux_sFQ&oe=6AFDDE97"}, {"file_name": "SCREENSHOT1.png", "id": "1726187108832816", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310734_1726187112166149_635600136569578536_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1B48PRAXFuwQ7kNvwFRGxQv&_nc_oc=Adp_YYatoKV3khEbNj8oPOI60O8A83qhjZdLuo-EEnFgK4YorcElVYuBNkOtthMxoQA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQMGhebs5fQOyNYZJ1nqggJQI2yAt745M80FiSGsmY-jA&oe=6AFDCEBC"}, {"file_name": "SCREENSHOT.png", "id": "1563254918652416", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310646_1563254921985749_8910419709266613584_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sPUedQcpF-QQ7kNvwEoonIP&_nc_oc=Adrisddz5BI8tOjZc8Tpe09lwWulKJc8OZ5aVjZ7hhqyuMiFWMzMNeKhTivxuk3S1CE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQRH28qDa1SrgH-vPFcI5nAgaUKHEqNJogXbPWMyRWkeQ&oe=6AFDB657"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "META_RISORSA_UNIVERSALE.png", "id": "2414280332391078", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499313072_2414280335724411_3358196128599980034_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7jFMkajblmkQ7kNvwH06rlb&_nc_oc=Adp3VgEzydhBufnamgPVObZvJ3eOGuBvDQErHD6C1RscxPttLwX_SNH9siHUM0SEW8k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR0rn02Le6PYZr8csme5JCu9OKy_4XZUS4qKOGFJ3Ao-g&oe=6AFDC44F"}, "display_name": "Eva Awakening Demo", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Every choice reshapes your reality.**\n\nEVA Awakening is a cinematic VR psychological sci-fi experience \u2014 an immersive narrative journey into a world suspended between machine, dream, and consciousness. Built from the ground up for virtual reality, every dialogue, every environment and every choice slowly reshapes your perception of what is real.\n\n*\"My existence is not a mistake. It is a question.\"*\n\n**Descend into the mind**\n\nExplore psychological spaces shaped by memory and emotion. As you move deeper, human consciousness fragments surface within the system, and the line between creator and creation begins to disappear.\n\n**Features**\n\n- True VR immersion \u2014 designed from the ground up for presence and hands-on interaction\n- Layered psychological narrative with branching choices that change how you perceive reality\n- Environmental and physical puzzles woven directly into the story\n- Cinematic atmosphere with an original soundtrack by Gabriele Boschi\n- Dialogue-driven progression in a hand-crafted sci-fi world\n- Headphones strongly recommended for the full experience\n\n**About this demo**\n\nThis demo offers a self-contained slice of EVA Awakening's world and atmosphere ahead of the full release.\n", "short_description": "A cinematic VR psychological sci-fi journey into memory and consciousness. Solve environmental puzzles and make choices that reshape reality, as the line between creator and creation disappears. \"My existence is not a mistake. It is a question.\""}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.ageinfinitygames.com/eva", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "AGEInfinityGames", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.ageinfinitygames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1008279844328894"}, {"id": "37797839027249